<title>FRANCE: Doctors strike in Algiers' hospitals.</title>
<headline>Doctors strike in Algiers' hospitals.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospital doctors went on strike in Algiers on Saturday to back demands for more pay, Algerian state-run radio said.</p>
<p>Emergency treatment and operations were not affected as the strikers provided essential services, the radio said.</p>
</text>
